    {
      "id": "bf268c9648f626e3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 2460,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 650,
      "text": "## 关系索引\n\n**E01** · Apple → 外部:Ford\nApple Maps EV routing and in-vehicle navigation for Ford Universal EV Platform\n\n**E02** · 外部:AMD → Microsoft\nAMD Helios, ND MI455X v7 and EPYC for Azure AI and HPC infrastructure\n\n**E03** · 外部:Mistral → Microsoft\nFrontier AI model services for enterprises and regulated industries\n\n**E04** · Alphabet / Google → 外部:Google Cloud customers\nGoogle Cloud AI services, TPU pods and cloud infrastructure\n\n**E05** · Anthropic → Amazon / AWS\nClaude Opus 5 availability on Amazon Bedrock\n\n**E06** · Meta → 外部:Meta users and advertisers\nFacebook, Instagram, WhatsApp, Threads and advertising systems\n\n**E07** · NVIDIA → 外部:SK Group / SK Telecom\nNVIDIA AI infrastructure for AI factories and SK Telecom AI infrastructure\n\n**E08** · SK Hynix → NVIDIA\nHBM and next-generation AI memory ecosystem",
      "color": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "dd52617dfea274aa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 2460,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 650,
      "text": "## 关系索引\n\n**E09** · Samsung Electronics → 外部:Broadcom\nHBM, 2nm-and-below foundry and 2.3D/2.5D advanced packaging\n\n**E10** · Tesla → 外部:EV and energy storage customers\nElectric vehicles, energy storage systems and energy services\n\n**E11** · TSMC → NVIDIA\nAdvanced-node foundry and advanced packaging for AI GPUs\n\n**E12** · TSMC → Apple\nAdvanced-node foundry for Apple A-series and M-series chips\n\n**E13** · NVIDIA → 外部:Safe Superintelligence\nVera Rubin systems, long-term compute access and compute-platform co-development\n\n**E14** · Amazon / AWS → OpenAI\nTrainium-based multi-year, multi-gigawatt AI compute commitment\n\n**E15** · Amazon / AWS → Anthropic\nTrainium-based multi-year, multi-gigawatt AI compute commitment\n\n**E16** · Microsoft → 外部:Azure and Copilot customers\nAzure cloud and AI services plus Microsoft 365 Copilot",
      "color": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "5fdd99799035720c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 2460,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 650,
      "text": "## 关系索引\n\n**E17** · Samsung Electronics → 外部:Five unnamed global data-center customers\nLong-term server-memory and AI-infrastructure chip supply contracts\n\n**E18** · SK Hynix → 外部:Around ten unnamed key memory customers\nHBM4, AI server DRAM, eSSD and long-term supply agreements\n\n**E19** · SK Hynix → 外部:Sandisk\nFirst open High Bandwidth Flash standard specification for AI inference memory tiers\n\n**E20** · OpenAI → Amazon / AWS\nDaybreak Blue and Daybreak Red cyber models available through Amazon Bedrock\n\n**E21** · 外部:Cerebras → OpenAI\nCerebras-powered GPT-5.6 Sol Ultrafast inference at up to 750 output tokens per second\n\n**E22** · NVIDIA → OpenAI\nNVIDIA DSX full-stack AI compute for approximately 8 IT-GW at PORTS-Pike\n\n**E23** · 外部:SB Energy → OpenAI\nLand, power and shell capacity for approximately 8 IT-GW under a 20-year lease\n\n**E24** · NVIDIA → Amazon / AWS\nTwo million additional Blackwell Ultra, Rubin and Rubin Ultra GPUs for AWS global infrastructure in 2027-2028",
      "color": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "551b6723f0e35e60",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 2460,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "## 关系索引\n\n**E25** · OpenAI → 外部:Cursor\nOpenAI model access in Cursor, with a proposed service shutoff on 2026-11-12",
      "color": "#334155"
    }
  ],
